		(descr "Capacitive caliper electrode seed: one 5.08 mm repeat of the 8-phase transmitter comb (0.30 x 5.00 mm fingers at 0.635 mm pitch, pads 1-8 = TX0-TX7) and a 5.08 x 1.20 mm receive strip (pad 9) whose centre is 3.8 mm below the comb centre. Layout extends both to 40 mm in copper on the same nets. Origin = finger TX0 centre.")
